{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby, move to it, take, check properties, perform task, then scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
            {
